    "Passo": {},
    "Passo Pro": {},
    "Passo 将扫描你相册中最近 20 张截图，自动识别其中包含的票据二维码或条形码。授权后点击「立即扫描」开始。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passo will scan the 20 most recent screenshots in your library and automatically detect ticket QR codes or barcodes. Grant access, then tap \"Scan Now\" to start."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "v%@": {},
