    "在任意 App 中找到要导入的票据截图，点击「分享」，然后选择「Passo」即可自动识别。首次使用前需在分享菜单中点「更多」启用 Passo。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In any app, find the ticket screenshot you want to import, tap \"Share\", then choose \"Passo\" to auto-detect it. Before first use, tap \"More\" in the share sheet to enable Passo."
          }
        }
      }
